      "documentation": "Completed logical data model for all 38 use cases. Main shows project access; numbered domain diagrams cover the entire model. NNA = required; NA = nullable; PK = primary key; FK = foreign key; AKn = unique key (same suffix forms a compound key). Multiplicities are real UML multiplicities. All new workflow and policy choices are design decisions, not additional facts from the use-case diagram. Status values and cross-row constraints are in entity documentation. Roles and project permissions are enforced in application transactions. Reports and progress are derived views, not duplicate stored totals. Historical loan, financial, notification and assignment records are retained."
    }
  ],
  "documentVersion": 1
